1
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:35,280
Are you sure you saw Lin Yihu?

2
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:35,880
Yes.

3
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,680
They must be conducting forward recon.

4
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:39,480
On my way back,

5
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,080
I also spotted traces of the 404th Brigade's

6
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:42,280
reconnaissance personnel.

7
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,200
It seems our 396th Brigade

8
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:47,560
is going to fight the 404th Brigade again.

9
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,240
Captain,

10
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,480
is there an exercise going on?

11
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:51,520
Captain,

12
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,800
we're also part of the 396th Brigade.

13
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:53,360
Can we participate?

14
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:54,200
Yeah, exactly.

15
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:56,520
We've been training for so long.

16
00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:57,680
I've wanted to fight them for ages.

17
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,000
Yeah, Captain.

18
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:00,280
What are you guys thinking?

19
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,720
Right now, we have no equipment.

20
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,160
It's just me and Squad Leader Yang

21
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,720
leading you twelve rookies.

22
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,240
Besides,

23
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:08,960
we haven't received any orders.

24
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,039
Captain,

25
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,800
should we avoid them?

26
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,200
Since we haven't received any orders,

27
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:21,080
we'll proceed with the original plan.

28
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:23,720
Continue to the area north of Guanxia Ridge

29
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,000
for field training.

30
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,360
Tonight's

31
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,040
training operation code name is:

32
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,000
Night Raiders.

33
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,560
The training subjects are:

34
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:34,960
Reconnaissance and Infiltration,

35
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,280
Behind-Enemy-Lines Capture,

36
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:38,480
and

37
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,320
Decapitation Strike.

38
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,680
Look alive, all of you!

39
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,360
Yes, sir!

40
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,080
Move out!

41
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:49,480
Yes, sir!

42
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,480
The positions of both sides.

43
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:02,320
The 404th Brigade

44
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:04,080
has entered the exercise area early.

45
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:06,280
The 1st and 2nd Battalions of the 396th Brigade

46
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:07,680
are also in position.

47
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:09,280
But this 3rd Battalion...

48
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,520
is still on the way.

49
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,880
Red Force misjudged the maneuver speed

50
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,920
of the Opposing Force.

51
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,280
Too careless.

52
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,640
Report!

53
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:19,440
Speak.

54
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,240
A small squad has entered the exercise area.

55
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,280
A squad?

56
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:24,240
What's the situation?

57
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,400
They climbed over from the cliff side.

58
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,440
They were just caught by our surveillance system.

59
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,360
Bring up the footage.

60
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,240
Yes, sir.

61
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,160
Isn't that Guo Zijian?

62
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:41,960
Yes, it is.

63
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,280
Commander,

64
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:46,640
you didn't already know this, did you?

65
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,640
I'm not a psychic.

66
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,320
However,

67
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,360
this exercise is near the Training Unit.

68
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,880
In a sense,

69
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:56,040
he can be considered part of Red Force.

70
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:56,880
True.

71
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:58,200
This kid

72
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,720
loves surprise attacks.

73
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:01,280
Then, Commander,

74
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,560
how should we handle this?

75
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:03,880
Since it's a training exercise,

76
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,320
don't tell Red Force or the Opposing Force.

77
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:08,640
Let these uninvited guests in,

78
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,720
and see what kind of chemical reaction

79
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:12,320
they trigger between Red Force and the Opposing Force.

80
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,600
One, he lacks command authority.

81
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,600
Two, he has no equipment.

82
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,360
I'm afraid that won't be very easy.

83
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:20,360
However,

84
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:23,040
Guo Zijian, who used to be in Red Force,

85
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,640
teaming up with

86
00:04:23,640 --> 00:04:25,400
Yang Maolin, who was in the Opposing Force...

87
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:27,040
That's quite an interesting combination.

88
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:28,920
Yeah.

89
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:32,440
See that?

90
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,440
Long Yuanshan has made his move.

91
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:38,280
This 3rd Battalion is in for it now.

92
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:57,640
Battalion Commander!

93
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,560
Enemy recon drone spotted ahead.

94
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,720
Disperse and take cover immediately.

95
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,040
Maintain radio silence.

96
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,520
Activate air defenses.

97
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,680
Defend against enemy attacks.

98
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:09,880
Copy that.

99
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,080
Monitor the enemy's air defenses closely.

100
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:37,880
Use long-range firepower first.

101
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:40,000
Army aviation formation, hold your strike for now

102
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,640
to avoid exposing our position.

103
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:42,760
Fire!

104
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:43,560
Yes, sir!

105
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,840
What are the 3rd Battalion's losses?

106
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:05,000
Report!

107
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,720
The 3rd Battalion convoy lost a total of

108
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,600
seven assault gun vehicles,

109
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,160
and 11 wheeled infantry fighting vehicles.

110
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,320
Good Lord!

111
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,960
How did the 3rd Battalion commander set up his defense?

112
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:14,440
A single wave of long-range strikes

113
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,000
took out all the heavy equipment

114
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:16,920
of an entire battalion.

115
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:18,640
Notify the 1st and 2nd Battalions.

116
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,760
Set up defenses at all costs.

117
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,560
Yes, sir!

118
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,200
Move!

119
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:26,560
Orders.

120
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,480
One.

121
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,560
Dispatch a recon detachment

122
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,880
against enemy forces stationed north of Guanxia Ridge

123
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,040
to conduct close-in reconnaissance.

124
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,040
Once verified,

125
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,400
dispatch an assault detachment

126
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,600
to ambush the 1st and 2nd Battalions' heavy equipment,

127
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,200
then use coordinates to guide our strikes.

128
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:39,960
Two.

129
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:42,200
Keep a platoon of elite recon troops in reserve,

130
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:43,520
ready to take out

131
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:44,880
Suo Jian'an's headquarters.

132
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:45,680
Yes, sir!

133
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,320
Captain.

134
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,400
When is the drone going in?

135
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,240
What's the rush?

136
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:09,600
With your half-baked skills,

137
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,440
you'd just be catching bullets out there.

138
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,560
Yang Maolin!

139
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,040
Here!

140
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,120
Have we confirmed the Opposing Force's command post location?

141
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:17,520
Based on the movement of the 404th Brigade,

142
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,480
I've analyzed the entire area.

143
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,400
Knowing Brigade Commander Long as I do,

144
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:23,200
the most likely location he'd choose

145
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,240
is Phoenix Cry Mountain.

146
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,560
Map.

147
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,000
From here,

148
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,040
heading to Phoenix Cry Mountain,

149
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:32,440
the shortest route is through Horsetail Gully,

150
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:34,640
taking this mountain path next to Height 174,

151
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,880
and then over this small hill.

152
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,320
Isn't that about 30 kilometers?

153
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,360
No,

154
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,120
it's 28.7 kilometers.

155
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:43,160
And on the way, we're highly likely to encounter

156
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,760
reconnaissance units from both forces

157
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:45,720
and assault units.

158
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:48,200
But we have nothing right now.

159
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:48,880
Well,

160
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,040
if we march there on foot,

161
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,200
forget about a Decapitation Strike,

162
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,240
the ship has sailed.

163
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:53,720
We may have nothing right now,

164
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:55,440
but once we enter the battlefield, we'll have everything.

165
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,960
You all remember this.

166
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:58,680
This is your first lesson:

167
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,840
improvise with local resources.

168
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:00,680
Yes, sir!

169
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,560
Instructor, Deputy Battalion Commander.

170
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:06,000
I heard about the situation with the 3rd Battalion.

171
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:06,960
I have a suggestion.

172
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:07,480
Go ahead.

173
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,720
To avoid concentrated close-range attacks,

174
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,560
and to maintain the agility of our fire points,

175
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,240
we should break up our formations.

176
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:13,920
I suggest

177
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,440
deploying the heavy firepower of the Assault Company

178
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,920
separately to the 1st and 2nd Companies.

179
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:17,480
Meanwhile,

180
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,160
other firepower should be divided the same way.

181
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,480
I know what you mean.

182
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:21,760
Just like last time,

183
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:23,440
the battalion combat group formed by Commander Guo.

184
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:24,160
Right?

185
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,200
Right.

186
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,120
My opinion

187
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,640
is to form two battalion combat groups.

188
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:30,520
Deputy Battalion Commander,

189
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:31,440
what are your thoughts?

190
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:34,960
This means breaking up the existing battalion's

191
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:36,400
entire firepower structure.

192
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,840
Changing formations right before battle...

193
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,000
I don't agree.

194
00:08:39,760 --> 00:08:40,360
Besides,

195
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:41,760
we haven't

196
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:42,799
submitted a report about this beforehand.

197
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:45,040
The battle is at our doorstep,

198
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:47,960
and you want to make last-minute changes.

199
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:50,160
The brigade leaders will absolutely not agree to this.

200
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:51,360
I think

201
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:53,280
there's no need to complicate things.

202
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,080
Zhou Jiadong!

203
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:00,480
Here!

204
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:01,800
Notify the Assault Company immediately

205
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,920
to distribute all their heavy weapons

206
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:04,520
to the combat sequences of the 1st and 2nd Companies.

207
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,400
What about the other firepower?

208
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,760
Focus on the main issue.

209
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,120
The rest can be arranged flexibly.

210
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:08,640
Yes, sir!

211
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,000
We spotted you a while ago.

212
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,000
Squad One,

213
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,000
continue your recon mission.

214
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,040
The rest of you, follow me.

215
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,440
Captain.

216
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:59,280
Are we really not going to save them?

217
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,080
What's the code name of our operation?

218
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,240
Night Raiders.

219
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,520
Are you stupid?

220
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:07,480
We're out here for training.

221
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:09,760
The guns we have aren't exercise weapons.

222
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:10,360
Can you guarantee

223
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,880
that without alerting anyone,

224
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,560
we can take them all out barehanded?

225
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,240
If we get exposed,

226
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:16,560
what then?

227
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,520
We only have one objective:

228
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:19,680
Decapitation Strike.

229
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:23,240
So we're just going to ignore everything else?

230
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,520
Who says we're ignoring them?

231
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,680
Since their squad

232
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:27,640
has already made it here,

233
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:29,520
it means they've discovered

234
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:30,600
the First Battalion's command post.

235
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:31,760
I've just

236
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:33,080
notified the First Battalion to respond,

237
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,160
and reported the situation to the Second Battalion

238
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,480
to call for backup.

239
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,320
Captain,

240
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:39,960
you have their Beidou ID numbers?

241
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:44,120
That's all we can do for now.

242
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:44,840
Let's go.

243
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,400
Follow those three scouts.

244
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:48,360
Right.

245
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,440
We can't handle the main force,

246
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:52,360
so we'll grab a few grunts first,

247
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,040
and take them down one by one.

248
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,200
Didn't you know our captain used to be

249
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:57,920
the commander of the First Battalion?

250
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,680
Instructor, Deputy Battalion Commander,

251
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,640
we just received a message.

252
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,560
The First Battalion's command post

253
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:11,680
has been exposed.

254
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,960
Who sent it?

255
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,880
The ID number isn't from our battalion.

256
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:16,680
Contact Lin Yihu immediately,

257
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:18,160
and find out what exactly is going on.

258
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:18,560
Yes, sir.

259
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,080
It's too late.

260
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:24,720
Instructor Sang,

261
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,200
unfortunately,

262
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,240
just now,

263
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,720
you have all been killed in action.

264
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,280
Furthermore,

265
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:31,520
an Opposing Force squad

266
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:33,480
has launched a surprise attack on your Assault Company.

267
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:35,160
All four artillery vehicles of your Assault Company

268
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:35,920
have been completely destroyed.

269
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,520
Although this message is anonymous,

270
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:48,000
should we contact the First Battalion?

271
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:49,800
Reporting to the Battalion Commander,

272
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:51,480
the First Battalion's command post was hit by the Opposing Force,

273
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,240
and the strike was effective.

274
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,440
It seems the message is true.

275
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:55,760
Who could it be?

276
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:58,840
Sir!

277
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,680
Our scouts in the southeast

278
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:02,240
spotted a small Opposing Force unit

279
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,920
approaching our Assault Company.

280
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,400
There are about 15 of them.

281
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:08,760
It seems they are targeting our heavy firepower.

282
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:10,040
Order!

283
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:10,720
Sir!

284
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:13,240
Have our assault squad move out immediately

285
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:15,520
to intercept and wipe out the Opposing Force squad.

286
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:16,080
Yes, sir.

287
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,960
This Long Yuanshan

288
00:12:19,520 --> 00:12:20,800
moves quite fast.

289
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:24,800
We were just one step away.

290
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,480
What a pity.

291
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,440
The Red Force has suffered

292
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,760
heavy losses this time.

293
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:33,600
If Guo Zijian thinks he can rely on a dozen men

294
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,960
to turn the tide of the battle...

295
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:36,280
That's too difficult.

296
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:37,560
Indeed.

297
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:39,640
But the shift towards special operations

298
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:41,440
is a trend for future battlefields.

299
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:44,040
They absolutely cannot fight alone.

300
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:45,800
They must rely on other combat forces

301
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:48,040
for comprehensive coordination and support

302
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,400
to become a truly sharp blade.

303
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,080
You are right, Chief.

304
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:26,800
Let's move.

305
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,120
Strip his gear.

306
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:30,560
Yes, sir.

307
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:49,600
Brigade Commander

308
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:51,720
The action against Red Force's 1st Battalion mostly succeeded.

309
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,440
But the small unit preparing to raid

310
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:53,920
the heavy equipment of Red Force's 2nd Battalion

311
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:54,800
was wiped out by the enemy.

312
00:13:58,520 --> 00:13:59,960
Judging by the current situation,

313
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:02,880
Red Force's 3rd Battalion is essentially crippled.

314
00:14:03,280 --> 00:14:05,360
The 1st Battalion's command post and assault company

315
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,720
have also practically been taken out by us.

316
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,960
Even the headquarters' direct units

317
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,000
have been heavily eroded by our small teams.

318
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:14,280
It's only against Jiang Shengqiang's 2nd Battalion

319
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,680
that our performance hasn't been ideal.

320
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:19,120
The main reason is our main force hasn't engaged yet.

321
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:26,680
Since we hold a complete advantage,

322
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:28,560
then against Jiang Shengqiang's 2nd Battalion,

323
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,760
let's go for a head-on

324
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:32,080
clash.

325
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:45,160
I brought you some steamed buns.

326
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:45,960
Go ahead and eat.

327
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:47,080
Thank you, sir.

328
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:47,920
I was just getting hungry.

329
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,480
Any new developments?

330
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:56,040
Your prediction was spot on, sir.

331
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:57,560
There's been no movement at all.

332
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:00,480
The silence before a major battle.

333
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:02,440
Sometime today,

334
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:03,760
there will definitely be a fierce battle.

335
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:05,960
I have the same feeling.

336
00:15:06,560 --> 00:15:08,680
I just wonder what tactics Long Yuanshan will use.

337
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:10,880
Speaking of tactics,

338
00:15:10,880 --> 00:15:13,240
I think Long Yuanshan and Guo Zijian...

339
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,720
...actually have some similarities.

340
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:17,080
Those two?

341
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:18,080
In what way?

342
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,600
Chinese warfare emphasizes strategy.

343
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,800
But when applying strategy,

344
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:26,400
the hardest part is striking the right balance.

345
00:15:27,160 --> 00:15:28,640
And when it comes to that balance,

346
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,080
Long Yuanshan and Guo Zijian...

347
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:31,360
...both of them in this regard...

348
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:33,920
...are quite gifted.

349
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,600
Sir, are you saying...

350
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:37,560
...they are both...

351
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:39,040
...naturally gifted commanders?

352
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,320
That's just my personal opinion.

353
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,480
To achieve greatness,

354
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:44,560
aside from having talent,

355
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:47,040
hard work is also indispensable.

356
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,560
Jade must be carved to become a gem.

357
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:51,440
Ling Jun,

358
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:53,680
time waits for no man.

359
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:56,200
We really don't have much time left.

360
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:58,240
We can only use the exercise field...

361
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:00,120
...to constantly set up obstacles...

362
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:02,000
...and test them repeatedly.

363
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:03,840
Rest assured, sir.

364
00:16:04,280 --> 00:16:05,600
All the effort you've put in...

365
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,600
...won't be in vain.

366
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:08,680
If Guo Zijian had truly given up,

367
00:16:08,800 --> 00:16:09,840
he wouldn't have come...

368
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:10,920
...to our exercise field.

369
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,040
What is their current position?

370
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,280
Moving towards Phoenix Cry Mountain.

371
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:26,000
This is a decapitation strike on Long Yuanshan.

372
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:27,120
He's trying to get revenge

373
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:28,880
for the loss he suffered last time.

374
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:32,520
Interesting.

375
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:35,440
The brigade command post sent a situation report.

376
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:36,440
They haven't discovered

377
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,800
the location of the 404th Brigade's command post.

378
00:16:38,680 --> 00:16:40,360
Their two combined arms battalions are very scattered,

379
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:41,160
and

380
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:42,000
it's hard to tell what's real.

381
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:43,000
Also,

382
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:44,880
I checked the ID on that Beidou handheld.

383
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:45,960
It belongs to the Training Unit.

384
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,480
But the Training Unit

385
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,720
isn't participating in this exercise.

386
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,040
No need to guess.

387
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,440
It must be Guo Zijian.

388
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:54,880
I knew that kid

389
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:55,840
wouldn't just sit still.

390
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,000
Pay close attention

391
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:58,440
to all messages from this ID.

392
00:16:58,440 --> 00:16:59,000
Yes, sir.

393
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:02,800
Continue monitoring.

394
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:03,240
Yes, sir.

395
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:05,240
Brigade Commander,

396
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:07,000
the 3rd and 4th Battalions have started moving

397
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,680
toward the 396th Brigade's 2nd Battalion.

398
00:17:10,119 --> 00:17:11,240
Order the 3rd and 4th Battalions

399
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,440
to attack from the east and south

400
00:17:12,599 --> 00:17:13,920
to converge on the 396th Brigade's 2nd Battalion.

401
00:17:14,319 --> 00:17:15,839
Of their allocated exercise ammunition,

402
00:17:16,079 --> 00:17:17,079
have each expend two-thirds.

403
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:19,160
Doesn't Jiang Shengqiang think he can fight?

404
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:21,319
Then we'll beat him to a pulp.

405
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:23,680
What about their remaining half of the 1st Battalion?

406
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:24,599
Leave them for now.

407
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:26,240
Focus our firepower on the 2nd Battalion,

408
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,079
then we'll deal with them.

409
00:17:28,319 --> 00:17:29,440
But if they take the initiative to attack

410
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,520
and meet up with the 2nd Battalion,

411
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:32,040
it will cause us a lot of trouble.

412
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:34,000
Then we'll suppress their communications.

413
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,480
Don't let a single message in or out.

414
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:37,320
And at

415
00:17:37,320 --> 00:17:38,640
every possible assault route,

416
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:39,680
station assault troops.

417
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:41,880
Create the illusion that we are forcing them

418
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,040
out of their base to annihilate them.

419
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:44,040
Set up a diversion

420
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:45,480
to make them think it's a trap,

421
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,440
so they won't dare make a move.

422
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,120
Exactly.

423
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:47,520
Yes, sir.

424
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:48,240
I'll arrange it immediately.

425
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:49,480
Have we found the 396th Brigade's command post?

426
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:50,120
We have a general location.

427
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:50,640
We haven't pinpointed it yet.

428
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,120
Keep looking.

429
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:52,120
You must find it.

430
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:52,800
Yes, sir.

431
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:53,520
Deploy immediately.

432
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:03,280
Take cover!

433
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:17,480
Captain, we have a situation.

434
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:19,240
It's the 3rd Battalion of the 404th Brigade.

435
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,440
Their direction of advance

436
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:21,600
is the same as ours.

437
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:24,760
Expect major movement ahead.

438
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,000
Everyone,

439
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:27,080
pick up the pace!

440
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:37,120
Long Yuanshan's go-to tactics...

441
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,560
First, sneak attacks.

442
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:40,040
Second, airstrikes.

443
00:18:40,360 --> 00:18:41,440
Third, surprise assaults.

444
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:42,680
Fourth, night raids.

445
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,280
After these initial moves,

446
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:46,360
it becomes a head-to-head showdown.

447
00:18:46,760 --> 00:18:47,600
I always feel that

448
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:48,880
when facing off against this guy,

449
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:51,200
I never have peace of mind.

450
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,400
We must not let our guard down.

451
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:54,880
Reporting!

452
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:55,640
Come in.

453
00:18:57,280 --> 00:18:57,880
What's the situation?

454
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,040
The Opposing Force has split east and south

455
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:00,680
to launch heavy strikes on our 2nd Battalion.

456
00:19:00,800 --> 00:19:01,560
Heavy?

457
00:19:02,040 --> 00:19:02,680
You see that?

458
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,360
A classic feint tactic.

459
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,480
Inform the 2nd Battalion

460
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:06,480
to maneuver tactically

461
00:19:06,560 --> 00:19:08,000
and be ready to mobilize at any time.

462
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:08,400
Yes, sir.

463
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:11,400
What's the situation with the 1st Battalion?

464
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:12,200
Sir,

465
00:19:12,280 --> 00:19:13,800
our comms with the 1st Battalion have been unstable.

466
00:19:13,800 --> 00:19:15,000
They must be facing electromagnetic interference.

467
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:04,320
That's not right.

468
00:20:04,520 --> 00:20:06,200
Long Yuanshan rarely fights pure wars of attrition.

469
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:08,800
Things don't add up.

470
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:10,000
It must be a diversion.

471
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,440
There has to be another plan behind this.

472
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:13,040
True or not,

473
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,680
we'll counter whatever they throw at us.

474
00:20:14,800 --> 00:20:16,400
If they fight, we fight. If they run, we chase.

475
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:17,840
We'll play along to the very end.

476
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:20,680
But it's two against one. We don't have the edge.

477
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:22,760
If

478
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:24,720
the 1st Battalion could join forces with us,

479
00:20:24,920 --> 00:20:25,960
our chances of winning would increase.

480
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:32,240
Send your suggestion to the command post.

481
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:33,360
Yes, sir.

482
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:34,160
Captain.

483
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:35,160
We're experiencing continuous jamming.

484
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:35,960
We still can't get through.

485
00:20:36,120 --> 00:20:36,840
Keep trying.

486
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:37,320
Yes, sir.

487
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:39,280
Why is the Opposing Force

488
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:41,040
using such heavy jamming on us

489
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:42,160
this time around?

490
00:20:42,280 --> 00:20:43,480
Isn't it obvious?

491
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:44,600
They just want to turn us

492
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:45,680
deaf and blind.

493
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:48,080
Right now, our camouflage and defenses

494
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,760
have given the 404th Brigade no openings.

495
00:20:50,320 --> 00:20:52,040
Long Yuanshan is trying to flush us out.

496
00:20:52,120 --> 00:20:53,080
As soon as we show ourselves,

497
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:54,160
they'll make their move.

498
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:55,080
Report.

499
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:55,760
Speak.

500
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,960
Captain, we just got word.

501
00:20:58,960 --> 00:20:59,680
The 404th Brigade is currently

502
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:01,120
attacking the 2nd Battalion from two directions.

503
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:02,000
Their firepower is heavy.

504
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:02,880
Understood.

505
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:03,720
Yes, sir.

506
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:10,320
Great.

507
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:13,440
Doesn't Jiang Shengqiang love a good fight?

508
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,360
Let them go head-to-head.

509
00:21:15,360 --> 00:21:16,320
And fight it out.

510
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:18,120
The fiercer, the better.

511
00:21:19,120 --> 00:21:20,640
Should we lend a hand?

512
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:23,080
Long Yuanshan has set a trap

513
00:21:23,080 --> 00:21:24,240
waiting for us to show ourselves.

514
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:26,080
We can't fall for it.

515
00:21:27,760 --> 00:21:30,200
But if we don't send reinforcements,

516
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:31,840
the 2nd Battalion will be wiped out.

517
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:34,000
It'll be hard to turn the tide after that.

518
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:41,160
Let me think.

519
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:45,480
The 396th Brigade's crippled forces

520
00:21:46,080 --> 00:21:47,240
are under information suppression

521
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:48,520
and too afraid to strike back.

522
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:50,960
Jiang Shengqiang just has to take the hit.

523
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:53,960
Long Yuanshan is pinning down Jiang Shengqiang

524
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:56,600
because he knows he's competitive

525
00:21:56,600 --> 00:21:57,880
and will turn it into a war of attrition.

526
00:21:58,240 --> 00:22:00,360
The 1st Battalion was spooked by the commandos,

527
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:03,040
and they lack battalion-level commanders.

528
00:22:03,040 --> 00:22:04,040
Their communications are cut off,

529
00:22:04,040 --> 00:22:05,680
so their best bet is to hold their ground.

530
00:22:06,040 --> 00:22:08,560
They won't launch an attack to save the 2nd Battalion.

531
00:22:08,600 --> 00:22:09,200
That's right.

532
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:10,280
Looks like

533
00:22:10,840 --> 00:22:11,720
when the 2nd Battalion falls,

534
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,920
the 1st Battalion will go down with them.

535
00:22:15,040 --> 00:22:16,800
However, with Suo Jian'an

536
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:18,200
setting up his command post in Fengyao Valley,

537
00:22:18,840 --> 00:22:21,720
it won't be easy for Long Yuanshan

538
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:22,800
to catch them red-handed like last time.

539
00:22:24,040 --> 00:22:25,240
If he can't catch them,

540
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:26,840
a Decapitation Strike would be cleaner.

541
00:22:27,080 --> 00:22:28,040
It all depends on whether

542
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:29,880
Guo Zijian can beat Long Yuanshan to it.

543
00:22:45,320 --> 00:22:46,040
Report, Captain!

544
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:47,160
The Opposing Force's 3rd and 4th Battalions

545
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:48,720
are flanking the Red Force's 2nd Battalion.

546
00:22:49,520 --> 00:22:50,320
Copy that.

547
00:22:57,800 --> 00:22:58,120
Captain,

548
00:22:58,520 --> 00:23:00,120
the Opposing Force sentries are on high alert.

549
00:23:00,560 --> 00:23:01,360
Close observation

550
00:23:01,800 --> 00:23:02,480
will easily expose us.

551
00:23:06,520 --> 00:23:07,400
Dongfang Qingtian!

552
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:07,760
Yes, sir!

553
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:09,240
Didn't you ask for a mission?

554
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:11,480
Launch your drone immediately.

555
00:23:11,560 --> 00:23:13,080
Control your altitude and angle

556
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:14,080
to avoid Opposing Force detection.

557
00:23:14,280 --> 00:23:14,840
Yes, sir!

558
00:24:00,840 --> 00:24:01,880
The 2nd Battalion is pinned down.

559
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:02,920
If we keep fighting like this,

560
00:24:03,040 --> 00:24:04,320
we won't last the night. We'll be completely wiped out.

561
00:24:04,560 --> 00:24:05,200
Chief of Staff!

562
00:24:05,560 --> 00:24:06,080
Sir!

563
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:09,440
Notify the 1st Battalion to flank from the right.

564
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:10,440
Strike fast and fall back.

565
00:24:10,600 --> 00:24:11,720
We still can't reach the 1st Battalion.

566
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:15,640
Who's commanding the 1st Battalion right now?

567
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:16,720
Li Songwei and Xu Zhiqiang.

568
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:17,400
They're co-commanding.

569
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:19,880
Those two aren't capable enough.

570
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:20,520
Keep trying to establish contact.

571
00:24:27,200 --> 00:24:28,280
Still can't reach them?

572
00:24:28,280 --> 00:24:28,920
No contact.

573
00:24:31,520 --> 00:24:32,440
What's the situation with the 2nd Battalion?

574
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,760
They're having a tough fight.

575
00:24:34,480 --> 00:24:35,960
If we go to reinforce them,

576
00:24:36,440 --> 00:24:37,280
we might be able to turn the tables.

577
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:38,200
But,

578
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:39,960
if it really is a trap,

579
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:40,760
I'm afraid we'll be

580
00:24:40,760 --> 00:24:42,320
wiped out as soon as we head out.

581
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,720
I remember...

582
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:58,080
the battalion commander once said...

583
00:24:58,240 --> 00:25:00,600
if you don't know where to kick the ball,

584
00:25:00,760 --> 00:25:02,200
just kick it into the opponent's goal.

585
00:25:05,040 --> 00:25:05,920
Did the battalion commander say that?

586
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:07,680
Don't give me that right now.

587
00:25:07,680 --> 00:25:08,120
Anyway,

588
00:25:08,120 --> 00:25:10,360
the most important battlefield now is at the 2nd Battalion.

589
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:12,960
Instead of hesitating,

590
00:25:13,240 --> 00:25:14,200
we should seize the opportunity

591
00:25:15,080 --> 00:25:15,680
and attack.

592
00:25:16,280 --> 00:25:17,320
Notify the whole company.

593
00:25:17,320 --> 00:25:18,120
Prepare for battle.

594
00:25:18,120 --> 00:25:18,720
Yes, sir.

595
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:21,920
Report.

596
00:25:22,080 --> 00:25:22,640
Speak.

597
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:23,840
The 1st Battalion has attacked.

598
00:25:26,360 --> 00:25:27,240
Good.

599
00:25:28,080 --> 00:25:29,520
I didn't expect Li Songwei

600
00:25:29,520 --> 00:25:30,640
to still be able to surprise us.

601
00:25:32,840 --> 00:25:34,200
Judging by the timing and the effect,

602
00:25:34,320 --> 00:25:35,480
the 1st Battalion's attack was spot on.

603
00:25:35,560 --> 00:25:36,120
Well played.

604
00:25:36,480 --> 00:25:38,160
With communications completely cut off,

605
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:39,160
their ability to still take the initiative to attack

606
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:40,000
is highly commendable.

607
00:25:40,320 --> 00:25:40,720
It seems

608
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:42,080
that the last exercise's

609
00:25:42,080 --> 00:25:43,680
battalion and company-level review played a major role.

610
00:25:43,840 --> 00:25:44,640
That's right.

611
00:25:49,040 --> 00:25:49,800
Great.

612
00:25:50,880 --> 00:25:51,800
As the Opposing Force,

613
00:25:51,800 --> 00:25:53,320
seeing the Red Force improve as we fight them

614
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:54,480
should make us happy.

615
00:25:55,320 --> 00:25:56,280
It's a pity that this way,

616
00:25:56,280 --> 00:25:57,560
our advantage is no longer obvious.

617
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:58,440
It's not a pity.

618
00:25:59,200 --> 00:26:01,160
This just shows my deployment wasn't clever enough.

619
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,400
It didn't intimidate their 1st Battalion.

620
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:04,240
But even if this half of the 1st Battalion joins in,

621
00:26:04,480 --> 00:26:05,640
I'm not afraid of them.

622
00:26:13,160 --> 00:26:13,720
Captain,

623
00:26:14,080 --> 00:26:15,560
Opposing Force 3rd Battalion fire positions are confirmed.

624
00:26:15,760 --> 00:26:16,920
Good. Return to base immediately.

625
00:26:17,120 --> 00:26:18,360
Yes, sir. Send the coordinates to Jiang Shengqiang.

626
00:26:18,520 --> 00:26:18,920
Yes, sir.

627
00:26:23,360 --> 00:26:23,920
Report.

628
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:25,480
That Beidou handheld device sent another message.

629
00:26:25,520 --> 00:26:26,080
It sent us

630
00:26:26,080 --> 00:26:27,400
the enemy 3rd Battalion's fire position coordinates.

631
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:28,960
Calculate based on the coordinates immediately

632
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:29,560
to verify their authenticity.

633
00:26:29,560 --> 00:26:30,040
Yes, sir.

634
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:37,880
Calculations confirm the information is correct.

635
00:26:38,080 --> 00:26:38,720
Very good.

636
00:26:39,440 --> 00:26:41,160
Order the artillery to conduct a fire strike.

637
00:26:41,160 --> 00:26:41,680
Yes, sir.

638
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:42,920
Also,

639
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:44,560
send scouts

640
00:26:44,840 --> 00:26:46,080
to find Guo Zijian's location.

641
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:46,720
Understood.

642
00:27:02,080 --> 00:27:02,800
Move out.

643
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:07,840
Look, look.

644
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:09,400
That kid Guo Zijian

645
00:27:09,680 --> 00:27:11,200
isn't slacking off on his decapitation strike.

646
00:27:12,320 --> 00:27:13,680
Long Yuanshan took a hit.

647
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:15,280
He's about to get ruthless.

648
00:27:21,080 --> 00:27:23,680
Didn't expect Jiang Shengqiang to be so capable.

649
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:26,320
He actually wiped out the 3rd Battalion's main firepower.

650
00:27:26,960 --> 00:27:28,760
Order the 3rd and 4th Battalions to withdraw.

651
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:31,040
Prepare to execute Plan B.

652
00:27:32,040 --> 00:27:33,280
Have the recon team

653
00:27:33,560 --> 00:27:34,880
locate the 1st and 2nd Battalions,

654
00:27:35,400 --> 00:27:37,080
along with the 396th Brigade command post,

655
00:27:37,080 --> 00:27:38,200
and pinpoint their exact positions.

656
00:27:40,720 --> 00:27:43,080
After nightfall, execute the decapitation strike.

657
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:44,120
Yes, sir.

658
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,520
Staff Officer Liang,

659
00:27:47,960 --> 00:27:50,440
why did we come to the Opposing Force's command post?

660
00:27:50,800 --> 00:27:52,200
This is so boring.

661
00:27:53,520 --> 00:27:54,480
Tell me,

662
00:27:54,600 --> 00:27:56,160
why can't the Red Force give the Opposing Force

663
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:57,120
a hard time?

664
00:28:00,280 --> 00:28:01,040
Squad Leader Hong,

665
00:28:02,440 --> 00:28:04,200
we can't just watch the show.

666
00:28:04,600 --> 00:28:06,520
We also need to focus on learning military operations.

667
00:28:06,960 --> 00:28:07,880
Staff Officer Liang,

668
00:28:08,080 --> 00:28:09,560
our directing squad's mission is to

669
00:28:09,560 --> 00:28:11,040
track the scene and judge fairly,

670
00:28:11,040 --> 00:28:12,520
set up realistic battlefield environments,

671
00:28:12,520 --> 00:28:13,840
and record actions to keep sufficient evidence.

672
00:28:13,920 --> 00:28:14,960
Isn't doing all that enough?

673
00:28:16,360 --> 00:28:17,520
You've memorized that quite well.

674
00:28:19,440 --> 00:28:20,240
But,

675
00:28:20,520 --> 00:28:22,320
if you want to grasp the overall situation,

676
00:28:22,320 --> 00:28:23,480
you still have to be at the command post.

677
00:28:24,760 --> 00:28:26,760
The last few times, we followed the Red Force.

678
00:28:26,960 --> 00:28:28,240
This time, we should also focus on the Opposing Force

679
00:28:28,240 --> 00:28:29,480
and do our homework properly.

680
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:32,320
Why do I feel like you have an ulterior motive?

681
00:28:33,600 --> 00:28:34,960
Do you think that

682
00:28:35,120 --> 00:28:36,720
Guo Zijian will launch a decapitation strike on Long Yuanshan,

683
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:38,160
so you're waiting for him here on purpose?

684
00:28:41,240 --> 00:28:42,480
I was right, wasn't I?

685
00:28:44,520 --> 00:28:45,600
I just want to collect

686
00:28:45,600 --> 00:28:47,160
the most valuable directing information.

687
00:28:47,480 --> 00:28:48,120
Right, right, right.

688
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:50,040
Guo Zijian is the most valuable information.

689
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:53,040
You're still laughing.

690
00:29:06,840 --> 00:29:08,160
Report! We found something.

691
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:11,400
Yang Maolin!

692
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:11,880
Sir!

693
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:18,600
Conduct an on-site recon.

694
00:29:18,600 --> 00:29:19,120
Yes, sir!

695
00:29:19,280 --> 00:29:20,760
Team Two, with me.

696
00:29:26,640 --> 00:29:27,440
Deputy Brigade Commander.

697
00:29:27,760 --> 00:29:29,560
Long Yuanshan hasn't made a move since his retreat.

698
00:29:29,720 --> 00:29:30,680
I suspect he's planning a night raid.

699
00:29:32,320 --> 00:29:34,000
Have we found the Opposing Force's command post?

700
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:37,680
The recon unit just reported back.

701
00:29:37,800 --> 00:29:38,720
Xiangsi Cliff.

702
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,640
Suspected tents of the Opposing Force's command post were spotted.

703
00:29:44,640 --> 00:29:45,240
Orders.

704
00:29:46,040 --> 00:29:47,200
Artillery strike on Xiangsi Cliff.

705
00:29:47,280 --> 00:29:47,960
Yes, sir!

706
00:29:49,480 --> 00:29:50,320
We must

707
00:29:51,080 --> 00:29:52,360
capture Long Yuanshan alive.

708
00:29:53,040 --> 00:29:53,880
Report, Captain!

709
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:56,280
It's been confirmed.

710
00:29:56,520 --> 00:29:58,200
The target spotted by the drone

711
00:29:58,200 --> 00:29:59,640
is the Opposing Force's command post.

712
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:02,120
Execute as planned.

713
00:30:02,120 --> 00:30:02,800
Yes, sir!

714
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:05,200
Move out!

715
00:30:24,960 --> 00:30:25,760
Is it connected?

716
00:30:26,080 --> 00:30:27,040
Almost done.

717
00:30:31,640 --> 00:30:32,600
All set, Captain.

718
00:30:33,800 --> 00:30:36,120
The Opposing Force command post is just ahead.

719
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:39,520
They'll set up at least two defense lines on the perimeter.

720
00:30:39,520 --> 00:30:40,280
Stay alert.

721
00:30:42,600 --> 00:30:43,240
Take cover!

722
00:30:51,840 --> 00:30:53,880
Who hits that hard?

723
00:30:54,600 --> 00:30:55,800
Oh, it's you, Sergeant Yang.

724
00:30:57,800 --> 00:30:59,480
You two are already dead.

725
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:00,840
Stay dead.

726
00:31:01,040 --> 00:31:01,760
Sergeant Yang...

727
00:31:01,760 --> 00:31:02,480
How did we become

728
00:31:02,480 --> 00:31:03,640
enemies so quickly?

729
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:04,600
Cut the crap.

730
00:31:05,280 --> 00:31:05,600
You,

731
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:06,680
tell me

732
00:31:07,160 --> 00:31:08,680
about the sentry layout inside.

733
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:10,160
Tell you what?

734
00:31:10,480 --> 00:31:12,240
You're the one who set them up.

735
00:31:14,520 --> 00:31:15,520
Forget I asked.

736
00:31:28,400 --> 00:31:28,960
Brigade Commander.

737
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:30,840
Just now, our command post at Xiangsi Cliff

738
00:31:30,840 --> 00:31:32,320
was hit by a long-range strike from the Red Force.

739
00:31:32,840 --> 00:31:33,640
Are we certain now

740
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:35,400
that the Red Force's command post is in Fengyao Valley?

741
00:31:35,520 --> 00:31:37,360
Two recon teams confirmed it from different directions.

742
00:31:37,360 --> 00:31:38,000
It's absolutely reliable.

743
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:40,040
What about the 396th Brigade's 1st and 2nd Battalion command posts?

744
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:41,120
All coordinates have been locked.

745
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:42,360
Concentrate all firepower.

746
00:31:42,560 --> 00:31:42,880
Fire!

747
00:31:42,920 --> 00:31:43,440
Yes, sir!

748
00:32:22,800 --> 00:32:24,440
Everyone, remember the objective.

749
00:32:25,200 --> 00:32:27,240
Once we pass another row of tents ahead,

750
00:32:27,440 --> 00:32:29,880
the searchlights will immediately lock onto us.

751
00:32:30,440 --> 00:32:32,400
As soon as they do, scatter immediately,

752
00:32:32,400 --> 00:32:33,360
and then open fire.

753
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:34,000
Squad Leader.

754
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:35,880
Why don't we shoot now?

755
00:32:36,120 --> 00:32:37,440
There's no time to explain.

756
00:32:37,640 --> 00:32:38,520
Just follow orders.

757
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:39,040
Yes, sir.

758
00:32:39,840 --> 00:32:41,560
Requesting orders to move.

759
00:32:41,560 --> 00:32:42,600
Proceed as planned.

760
00:32:42,640 --> 00:32:43,280
Yes, sir.

761
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:12,000
Halt! Password!

762
00:33:15,520 --> 00:33:16,000
Fire!

763
00:33:47,520 --> 00:33:49,280
Isn't that Yang Maolin?

764
00:33:49,680 --> 00:33:51,240
Isn't he from the 404th Brigade?

765
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:52,960
Why is he fighting his own people?

766
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:56,160
He voluntarily applied to Deputy Commander Liang

767
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:57,360
to join the 396th Brigade.

768
00:33:57,600 --> 00:33:59,000
He's in the Training Unit now.

769
00:33:59,120 --> 00:34:00,640
Is he crazy?

770
00:34:01,120 --> 00:34:02,640
Giving up his spot in the ace Opposing Force

771
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:05,040
to go to such a remote place.

772
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:08,040
He did it for Wu Dongsheng.

773
00:34:08,480 --> 00:34:09,560
Sorry, Squad Leader Yang.

774
00:34:09,800 --> 00:34:10,960
Since we are opponents now,

775
00:34:11,280 --> 00:34:12,840
the traps you laid out before

776
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,400
have almost all been dismantled by us.

777
00:34:15,320 --> 00:34:15,880
I didn't expect

778
00:34:16,040 --> 00:34:18,120
you to still take out all our observation posts.

779
00:34:18,159 --> 00:34:18,960
Good kid.

780
00:34:19,560 --> 00:34:20,360
You've improved.

781
00:34:21,040 --> 00:34:23,320
Escort Yang Maolin to the command post.

782
00:34:23,560 --> 00:34:24,639
The brigade commander wants to see him.

783
00:34:25,199 --> 00:34:26,639
Take the rest of them away.

784
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:27,639
After you.

785
00:34:28,239 --> 00:34:28,719
Move.

786
00:34:29,560 --> 00:34:29,960
Move.

787
00:34:35,560 --> 00:34:36,120
Everyone,

788
00:34:36,760 --> 00:34:38,000
put silencers on your primary weapons.

789
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:44,040
Move out!

790
00:34:44,679 --> 00:34:45,120
Yes, sir.

791
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:48,840
Just one step away.

792
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:52,960
What's wrong? Disappointed?

793
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:54,360
Not at all.

794
00:34:54,960 --> 00:34:56,280
With just a few guys,

795
00:34:56,520 --> 00:34:57,760
they took out almost all of

796
00:34:57,760 --> 00:34:58,840
the Opposing Force's sentries.

797
00:34:59,120 --> 00:34:59,720
Impressive.

798
00:35:01,840 --> 00:35:03,120
But this Yang Maolin,

799
00:35:03,120 --> 00:35:04,360
he really is a tough guy of few words.

800
00:35:04,720 --> 00:35:06,360
He's an absolute beast.

801
00:35:08,840 --> 00:35:09,520
Staff Officer Liang.

802
00:35:10,200 --> 00:35:11,160
What are you thinking about?

803
00:35:11,440 --> 00:35:13,640
Yang Maolin is from the 396th Brigade's Training Unit.

804
00:35:14,920 --> 00:35:15,640
Right.

805
00:35:15,880 --> 00:35:16,120
Then,

806
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:16,880
if

807
00:35:17,320 --> 00:35:18,120
he's shown up,

808
00:35:18,240 --> 00:35:19,320
wouldn't Guo Zijian

809
00:35:20,400 --> 00:35:21,120
show up soon too?

810
00:35:21,200 --> 00:35:22,320
Am I right, Staff Officer Liang?

811
00:35:22,520 --> 00:35:23,840
Long Yuanshan has already located

812
00:35:23,840 --> 00:35:24,880
the Red Force's command center.

813
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,200
And issued the strike order.

814
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:28,520
If the strike is effective,

815
00:35:28,520 --> 00:35:29,680
then the exercise is over.

816
00:35:29,880 --> 00:35:31,360
If it's not over, there's still a chance.

817
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:32,440
Usually, the big bosses

818
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:34,160
always make a grand entrance at the end, right?

819
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:35,720
I have a feeling

820
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:37,120
he's about to show up.

821
00:35:37,960 --> 00:35:38,680
Yang Maolin.

822
00:35:40,040 --> 00:35:41,560
I told you a long time ago.

823
00:35:41,720 --> 00:35:43,360
Once you leave our 404th Brigade,

824
00:35:43,640 --> 00:35:46,280
it'll be hard for you to feel the joy of winning again.

825
00:35:47,040 --> 00:35:47,960
I just didn't expect

826
00:35:47,960 --> 00:35:50,080
this warning to come true so quickly.

827
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:53,000
Normally,

828
00:35:53,600 --> 00:35:55,080
a captive is also my guest.

829
00:35:55,560 --> 00:35:56,520
But you're not.

830
00:35:56,520 --> 00:35:57,320
Because you...

831
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:03,320
Forget it.

832
00:36:04,720 --> 00:36:05,440
At the end of the day,

833
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:06,840
you're still a soldier I trained.

834
00:36:07,520 --> 00:36:09,000
I won't hold it against you.

835
00:36:10,120 --> 00:36:11,440
Keep your eyes on the big screen.

836
00:36:12,080 --> 00:36:13,520
The group army commander will soon

837
00:36:13,520 --> 00:36:15,000
announce the end of the exercise.

838
00:36:15,320 --> 00:36:17,880
The 404th Brigade has won a total victory.

839
00:36:31,800 --> 00:36:32,920
All those combat skills,

840
00:36:34,160 --> 00:36:35,120
once at the 396th,

841
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:36,600
are completely wasted.

842
00:36:58,120 --> 00:37:00,960
Yang Maolin really got chewed out.

843
00:37:02,480 --> 00:37:03,720
Squad Leader Yang's biggest mistake

844
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:05,560
was going against the Brigade Commander.

845
00:37:05,720 --> 00:37:06,320
Alright.

846
00:37:06,640 --> 00:37:07,680
The commander has ordered

847
00:37:07,680 --> 00:37:09,280
a strike on the Red Force's command post.

848
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:11,320
We'll see the results of the strike soon.

849
00:37:14,160 --> 00:37:15,480
Flank security in position.

850
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:16,640
Number Five in position.

851
00:37:16,640 --> 00:37:18,360
Number Six in position. Number Seven in position.

852
00:37:19,400 --> 00:37:20,040
On my mark.

853
00:37:21,560 --> 00:37:24,080
So that means this exercise is over.

854
00:37:24,440 --> 00:37:25,080
That's great.

855
00:37:25,200 --> 00:37:25,720
Move!

856
00:37:50,760 --> 00:37:52,320
He's here! Guo Zijian is here!

857
00:37:58,200 --> 00:37:59,440
Too bad he's still a step too late.

858
00:37:59,760 --> 00:38:00,360
I declare that

859
00:38:01,240 --> 00:38:02,960
the Opposing Force's strike is valid.

860
00:38:03,760 --> 00:38:06,280
In the 404th Brigade's pre-deployment warm-up match,

861
00:38:06,920 --> 00:38:08,600
the 404th Brigade is the winner.

862
00:38:10,280 --> 00:38:11,480
Don't move!

863
00:38:12,120 --> 00:38:13,600
Sit down! Sit down!

864
00:38:13,600 --> 00:38:14,200
Sit down!

865
00:38:19,400 --> 00:38:22,080
Even if the 396th Brigade's special ops team

866
00:38:22,080 --> 00:38:24,080
stands in the 404th Brigade's command post right now,

867
00:38:24,800 --> 00:38:26,240
it won't change the outcome.

868
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:31,080
Put them down! Put them down!

869
00:38:31,080 --> 00:38:32,440
Didn't you hear what Deputy Corps Commander Liang said?

870
00:38:32,680 --> 00:38:33,480
Stop waving those around!

871
00:38:33,760 --> 00:38:34,520
Put them down! Put them down!

872
00:38:45,080 --> 00:38:46,240
I really didn't expect

873
00:38:46,920 --> 00:38:47,880
that such a

874
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:51,080
newly formed rookie squad

875
00:38:51,440 --> 00:38:53,640
would almost succeed in a decapitation strike.

876
00:38:54,240 --> 00:38:55,120
Yeah.

877
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:57,840
I've watched so many exercises,

878
00:38:58,440 --> 00:38:59,800
and this kind of outcome,

879
00:39:00,080 --> 00:39:01,440
this is the first time I've seen it.

880
00:39:07,520 --> 00:39:08,640
Interesting.

881
00:39:12,040 --> 00:39:13,120
Unbelievable.

882
00:39:15,760 --> 00:39:16,640
Unbelievable.

883
00:39:18,800 --> 00:39:20,480
If we were just a bit earlier...

884
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:22,040
If...

885
00:39:22,160 --> 00:39:24,120
If we were just a little bit faster...

886
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:27,240
If we hadn't been delayed along the way...

887
00:39:27,680 --> 00:39:28,520
If...

888
00:39:30,080 --> 00:39:30,920
Guo Zijian.

889
00:39:31,280 --> 00:39:33,040
Is that what you're thinking right now?

890
00:39:33,760 --> 00:39:34,840
A loss is a loss.

891
00:39:35,440 --> 00:39:36,200
There are no ifs.

892
00:39:36,680 --> 00:39:37,720
Still talking tough.

893
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:41,360
We weren't even a part of

894
00:39:41,840 --> 00:39:43,760
the exercise's communication system.

895
00:39:44,160 --> 00:39:47,000
Nor did we know your exact strike time.

896
00:39:47,160 --> 00:39:48,640
We just got lucky.

897
00:39:49,440 --> 00:39:49,840
If

898
00:39:49,840 --> 00:39:51,880
we weren't in the final phase of the exercise,

899
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:55,080
if our familiar comrade Yang Maolin hadn't been captured,

900
00:39:55,640 --> 00:39:57,280
if there weren't so many coincidences,

901
00:39:57,680 --> 00:39:59,240
I wouldn't have made it into your command post.

902
00:40:01,320 --> 00:40:02,960
Just for your frankness alone,

903
00:40:03,720 --> 00:40:05,160
you've definitely made a friend in me.

904
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:09,520
However, this kind of coincidence in our 404th Brigade

905
00:40:10,040 --> 00:40:11,880
will absolutely never happen a second time.

906
00:40:12,320 --> 00:40:13,080
I believe that.

907
00:40:14,480 --> 00:40:15,720
But I must also remind Brigade Commander Long,

908
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:18,320
in the era of big data,

909
00:40:18,560 --> 00:40:19,800
many coincidences

910
00:40:20,040 --> 00:40:21,600
can actually be calculated.

911
00:40:22,080 --> 00:40:23,520
I agree with what you're saying.

912
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:26,440
I really didn't expect that,

913
00:40:27,600 --> 00:40:29,280
after just a few days,

914
00:40:29,520 --> 00:40:30,800
we, as the whetstone,

915
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:32,320
would get ground down so hard ourselves.

916
00:40:33,520 --> 00:40:35,560
The 396th Brigade truly is full of hidden talents.

917
00:40:36,520 --> 00:40:37,120
What a thrill!

918
00:40:38,080 --> 00:40:38,720
So satisfying!

919
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:48,520
Report!

920
00:40:52,720 --> 00:40:53,520
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

921
00:40:53,880 --> 00:40:54,960
Are you here by yourself?

922
00:40:55,120 --> 00:40:55,880
Where is the Commissar?

923
00:40:56,200 --> 00:40:57,840
The troops are withdrawing soon.

924
00:40:57,960 --> 00:40:59,800
The Commissar wanted to be sure, so he went to check the site.

925
00:41:01,240 --> 00:41:02,040
There's something

926
00:41:04,120 --> 00:41:05,160
that doesn't seem right to me.

927
00:41:05,680 --> 00:41:06,520
What is it?

928
00:41:07,160 --> 00:41:09,720
It's about Guo Zijian trying to capture Long Yuanshan.

929
00:41:12,560 --> 00:41:13,760
It's a pity he was one step too late.

930
00:41:18,920 --> 00:41:22,240
This isn't about it being a pity at all.

931
00:41:22,600 --> 00:41:24,480
I think he did it on purpose.

932
00:41:27,560 --> 00:41:29,760
Don't make baseless assumptions.

933
00:41:30,160 --> 00:41:30,840
Do you know

934
00:41:30,880 --> 00:41:32,440
the day Guo Zijian returned from leave,

935
00:41:32,720 --> 00:41:33,880
how he got back?

936
00:41:36,240 --> 00:41:37,280
He rode in Long Yuanshan's car.

937
00:41:39,280 --> 00:41:40,320
What does that mean?

938
00:41:40,760 --> 00:41:43,200
It means he's worried he won't last in the 396th Brigade,

939
00:41:43,200 --> 00:41:45,120
so he's already looking for a backup plan.

940
00:41:48,240 --> 00:41:49,560
I doubt he'd go that far.

941
00:41:50,320 --> 00:41:51,680
I didn't think he'd go that far either.

942
00:41:51,680 --> 00:41:52,880
I didn't think so before.

943
00:41:53,320 --> 00:41:54,800
But look at this time.

944
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:56,320
How could it be such a coincidence?

945
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:57,760
He was just one step late.

946
00:41:57,880 --> 00:41:59,800
If he had gone in one second earlier,

947
00:41:59,800 --> 00:42:00,560
just one second,

948
00:42:01,120 --> 00:42:03,200
wouldn't the outcome be completely different?

949
00:42:03,720 --> 00:42:05,360
Yet he missed it by exactly one second.

950
00:42:06,720 --> 00:42:07,960
So I'm guessing

951
00:42:08,080 --> 00:42:10,240
he deliberately chose this critical moment

952
00:42:10,680 --> 00:42:11,840
to make all of us

953
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:12,640
not only feel

954
00:42:13,520 --> 00:42:14,440
that he's amazing

955
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:16,200
and could have easily caught Long Yuanshan,

956
00:42:16,640 --> 00:42:17,840
but also make us think

957
00:42:17,840 --> 00:42:19,760
that the 396th Brigade can't do without him.

958
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:20,680
But at the same time,

959
00:42:20,960 --> 00:42:22,960
he intentionally let Long Yuanshan off the hook

960
00:42:23,200 --> 00:42:25,560
to do a favor for the 404th Brigade.

961
00:42:27,520 --> 00:42:28,480
Tell me,

962
00:42:28,560 --> 00:42:30,040
if he made up his mind

963
00:42:30,040 --> 00:42:31,160
to leave with Long Yuanshan,

964
00:42:31,600 --> 00:42:33,600
no one would stop him, right?

965
00:42:34,200 --> 00:42:35,480
But his current behavior

966
00:42:35,480 --> 00:42:37,600
of wanting to have his cake and eat it too

967
00:42:37,600 --> 00:42:39,520
is truly shameful.

968
00:42:41,520 --> 00:42:43,320
You've been talking all this time,

969
00:42:43,840 --> 00:42:44,520
but it's all just your

970
00:42:45,800 --> 00:42:46,680
speculation.

971
00:42:47,080 --> 00:42:47,680
Yes.

972
00:42:47,920 --> 00:42:49,720
But you can't deny

973
00:42:50,320 --> 00:42:51,920
that it's a possibility, right?
